✅ **Edge cases handled**: Empty dataframes, single values, multiple regions/units all work correctly
✅ **Backward compatibility**: No breaking changes to API or expected behavior

The fix is minimal, targeted, and addresses the core semantic issue while maintaining full compatibility with existing code.
